.task-board/EPIC-260716-3fyjn0_manual-validation-and-approvals/STORY-260716-2cjf4i_m2-physical-validation/TASK-260715-2m7lwo_run-macos-udp-and-dns-exit-validation/README.md:7:In scope: supported physical Apple-silicon Mac and macOS; generated development provider; controlled SSH exit; controlled IPv4 and IPv6 UDP echo or application fixtures; domain-destination fixture; approved resolver; dig or equivalent UDP and TCP DNS clients; authorized physical and exit captures; stable Ethernet or Wi-Fi starting path; association and drop counters; memory; relay process evidence; repeated start and stop; redaction. Out of scope: network transitions, sleep or wake, NAT64 transition, captive recovery, degraded-mode transitions, final QUIC policy, notarization, production traffic, legacy product behavior, and unsupported Intel client hardware.
