.task-board/EPIC-260715-2mqgvm_viability-and-foundation/progress.md:38:Solution-architect decomposition: refined all five stories and created 49 atomic backlog tasks with explicit in/out scope, numbered AC, task-specific checklists, and 85 dependency links. Canonical phases are Gate A0 plus Gate P0 in parallel, then generated project foundation, then packet bridge and HEV, then SSH selection; the comparative SSH memory gate consumes the packet and HEV baseline. Added blocking evidence or decision work for authoritative Apple intent, Apple identities and devices, generator and deployment targets, relay toolchain, measured packet defaults and fork policy, and SSH engine selection. Outcome resources: EPIC-260715-2mqgvm_decomposition-summary.md, EPIC-260715-2mqgvm_logbook.md, EPIC-260715-2mqgvm_canonical-plan.md, EPIC-260715-2mqgvm_gate-dependency.dot, and diagram-validation log. No implementation or source/specification edit was performed.
