.task-board/EPIC-260715-w5gzf4_release-and-distribution/STORY-260717-1ecq74_macos-self-update/TASK-260728-3bj9bk_pin-sparkle-public-key-and-verify-appcast-signing/README.md:7:In scope: SUPublicEDKey insertion into the generated macOS host Info.plist and its Tuist manifest source of truth; binding the CI appcast signing secret to the protected release environment; a dry-run that signs a test appcast entry and verifies it with the updater vendor verification tool; negative cases for absent, malformed, and mismatched public keys, each of which must fail closed; recording the public key and its fingerprint as non-secret evidence. Out of scope: generating the keypair or touching private key bytes (TASK-260717-ziprhs); Developer ID signing and notarization (TASK-260715-3sk5cd, TASK-260715-387eof); publishing real release assets (TASK-260715-1njthi); updater UI and scheduling (TASK-260717-rk4mi7); iOS.
