252:| `privateKeyBytes` | `UInt32` length + bytes; 1...49,152 | Exact imported/generated representation; secret |
253:| `passphrase` | presence + `UInt32` length + bytes; 0...4,096 | Optional UTF-8 bytes; secret; empty is distinct from absent |
